rue\"></div><div class=\"hero-cursor-aura\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"hero-light-rays\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class=\"hero-shade\"></div><div class=\"hero-kicker kicker-enter\"><span>Personal archive</span><span>Hangzhou · Bangkok</span></div><div class=\"hero-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow hero-enter\">一个关于时间、信念与收藏的私人空间</p><h1 class=\"hero-enter delay-one\">把生活，<em>藏成一座博物馆。</em></h1><div class=\"hero-bottom hero-enter delay-two\"><p>记录那些值得被记住的时刻，<br/>也收藏人与物之间安静的缘分。</p><a class=\"round-link\" href=\"#journal\" aria-label=\"开始浏览\"><span>向下</span><b>↓</b></a></div></div></header><section class=\"intro\" id=\"about\"><div class=\"section-index\" data-reveal=\"true\"><span>01</span><span>Manifesto</span></div><div class=\"intro-main\" data-reveal=\"true\"><p class=\"eyebrow dark\">关于我 · ABOUT</p><h2>我相信真正的高级，<br/>是经历世界之后，<br/>仍保有一颗<span>安静的心。</span></h2></div><div class=\"intro-aside\" data-reveal=\"true\"><p>这里不是一份标准答案，而是一间持续生长的私人档案馆。关于旅行、审美、收藏，也关于如何成为自己。</p><div class=\"presence\"><span class=\"pulse\"></span><span>此刻在线 · 杭州</span></div></div></section><section class=\"quote-band\" aria-label=\"人生感悟\"><p data-reveal=\"true\">“人这一生，不是要拥有所有，<br/>而是要认出<span>什么值得珍惜。</span>”</p><div class=\"visitor-mark\"><span>Visitor No.</span><strong>008,426</strong></div></section><section class=\"journal section-shell\" id=\"journal\"><div class=\"section-heading\" data-reveal=\"true\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow dark\">02 · Journal</span><h2>片刻与思考</h2></div><p>写下来的，是已经与自己和解的事。</p></div><div class=\"article-list\"><button class=\"article-row\" type=\"button\" data-reveal=\"true\"><span class=\"article-number\">0<!-- -->1</span><span class=\"article-meta\"><b>人生随笔</b><small>18 JUL 2026</small></span><span class=\"article-title\"><span>允许一切发生，</span><span>也允许自己慢下来</span></span><span class=\"article-excerpt\">成熟不是越来越擅长对抗世界，而是终于懂得，把有限的心力留给真正重要的事。</span><span class=\"article-arrow\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></span></button><button class=\"article-row\" type=\"button\" data-reveal=\"true\"><span class=\"article-number\">0<!-- -->2</span><span class=\"article-meta\"><b>旅途札记</b><small>02 JUN 2026</small></span><span class=\"article-title\"><span>在清迈，时间有了</span><span>另一种刻度</span></span><span class=\"article-excerpt\">清晨六点的钟声、雨后发亮的石阶，以及一碗热汤里最朴素的满足。</span><span class=\"article-arrow\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></span></button><button class=\"article-row\" type=\"button\" data-reveal=\"true\"><span class=\"article-number\">0<!-- -->3</span><span class=\"article-meta\"><b>收藏手记</b><small>09 MAY 2026</small></span><span class=\"article-title\"><span>一枚旧佛牌，</span><span>收藏的是时间</span></span><span class=\"article-excerpt\">它的价值不只在稀有，更在于辗转过谁的掌心，又陪谁走过怎样的年月。</span><span class=\"article-arrow\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></span></button></div></section><section class=\"gallery section-shell\" id=\"gallery\"><div class=\"section-heading light\" data-reveal=\"true\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">03 · Visual diary</span><h2>私人影像</h2></div><div class=\"gallery-actions\"><p>一些没有答案，但值得记住的瞬间。</p><input type=\"file\" accept=\"image/*\" multiple=\"\" hidden=\"\"/><button class=\"outline-button light-button\" type=\"button\">＋ 上传照片</button></div></div><div class=\"gallery-grid\"><figure class=\"gallery-card gallery-1\" data-reveal=\"true\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1710586008725-c7a8b3812f63?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1100&amp;q=78\" alt=\"曼谷寺庙的黑白阶梯\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/><figcaption><span>Bangkok</span><span>03 · 2024</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"gallery-card gallery-2\" data-reveal=\"true\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1646850149204-55d96d99ee24?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1100&amp;q=78\" alt=\"清迈寺庙的金色内殿\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/><figcaption><span>Chiang Mai</span><span>11 · 2023</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"gallery-card gallery-3\" data-reveal=\"true\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1670152251155-5